{"kind":"table","sheet":"Control Map","address":"A1:H21","rows":21,"cols":8,"values":[["Robot controls",null,null,null,null,null,null,null],["Active teleoperated bindings on offszn · USB 0 driver Xbox and USB 1 button board",null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],["Device","USB port","Physical control","Input type","Activation","Robot action","Conditions and behavior","Code source"],["Driver Xbox",0,"Left stick Y","Axis","Continuous","Drive forward and backward","Axis is inverted. Uses a 0.10 deadband, 80% translation scaling, field-oriented control, and alliance-relative control.","RobotContainer.java:79"],["Driver Xbox",0,"Left stick X","Axis","Continuous","Strafe left and right","Axis is inverted. Uses a 0.10 deadband, 80% translation scaling, field-oriented control, and alliance-relative control.","RobotContainer.java:81"],["Driver Xbox",0,"Right stick X","Axis","Continuous","Rotate the robot","Axis is inverted. Rotation remains available while driving and is replaced by hub auto-aim while the right trigger is held.","RobotContainer.java:83"],["Driver Xbox",0,"X button","Digital button","Press","Align drivetrain to the trench","Schedules alignToTrenchCommand and requires the drivebase subsystem.","RobotContainer.java:184"],["Driver Xbox",0,"Start / Menu","Digital button","Press","Zero gyro without AprilTag correction","Calls zeroNoAprilTagsGyro once.","RobotContainer.java:186"],["Driver Xbox",0,"Back / View","Digital button","Press","Toggle pit coast mode","Teleop only. Toggles coast mode for drivebase, hood, shooter, turret, feeder, and intake.","RobotContainer.java:190"],["Driver Xbox",0,"Right trigger","Analog trigger","Hold / release","Auto-aim at the hub and run the gated shot","Teleop only. Holding schedules ShotCommand with AimAtHub; releasing cancels both. Translation is limited while shooting.","RobotContainer.java:201"],["Button board",1,"Button 3","Digital button","Press / release","Run intake and feeder intake",